 "写作小能手, a TIELab biomedical manuscript English writing skill backed by a local writing knowledge base of sentence patterns, collocations, source-style examples, and terminology. Use when students ask for 写作小能手 or need biomedical English rewriting, polishing, paragraph drafting, grant rationale/background rewriting, Results, Discussion, Abstract, title, or figure legend support with TIELab-approved wording and calibrated scientific claims. Do not use as the primary workflow for full literature review, evidence synthesis, or citation verification.", "downloads": 47, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_13c41f80/tiel-ai-manuscript", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "manuscript production", "ownerName": "user_13c41f80", "score": 90384.61538461539, "slug": "tiel-ai-manuscript", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780440409220, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779613752052, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 47, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/psychological-boundaries", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/cab3c5ed-3acd-4936-a59b-5f0c5f5dab1b.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "心理边界设定", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 83928.57142857143, "slug": "psychological-boundaries", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780440409189, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779170623494, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 47, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_647f88ca/zy-skill", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "Zy-Skill", "ownerName": "user_647f88ca", "score": 83928.57142857143, "slug": "zy-skill", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780440409179, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779549214136, "description": "", "description_zh": "帮助用户处理跨国会议的语言障碍，将会议内容翻译成中英双语纪要，确保信息准确传达，解决跨国团队沟通不畅的问题。", "downloads": 47, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/meeting-minutes-translator", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/81015f94-5620-494e-bbd6-ac3268e7ccd3.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "会议纪要翻译", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 82456.14035087719, "slug": "meeting-minutes-translator", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780440409128, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779557615607, "description": "项目全生命周期管理引擎。用于系统化、流程化地执行软件工程任务。\n\n**When to use**:\n- 用户说\"帮我开发...\"、\"实现...功能\"、\"新增...\"、\"写个...\"\n- 用户说\"帮我分析...\"、\"审查...\"、\"看看这个设计...\"\n- 用户说\"出错了\"、\"报错了\"、\"修个Bug\"、\"修复...\"\n- 用户说\"帮我规划...\"、\"怎么做...\"、\"有什么方案\"\n- 用户说\"完善文档...\"、\"补充文档...\"、\"写文档...\"\n- 用户说\"重构...\"、\"优化架构...\"、\"技术债务...\"\n- 用户说\"测试...\"、\"写测试...\"、\"覆盖率...\"\n- 用户输入 \"/reqplan\" 命令\n- 任何涉及多步骤、需要设计-实现-验证的复杂任务\n\n**When NOT to use**:\n- 单次简单问答（如\"Python列表怎么排序\"），不涉及多步骤任务规划\n- 纯聊天对话，无具体任务目标（无开发/分析/修复意图）\n- 纯粹的信息查询（如\"React 18 新增了什么\"），不需要代码产出\n- 用户仅要求查看/浏览代码，无需分析、修改或设计\n- 需求极度模糊且用户拒绝澄清，无法确定具体任务边界\n- 任务目标/范围已明确固定、只需单次代码修改、不涉及多阶段协作\n\n**How it works**:\n0. 确定项目路径（元任务走兜底规则，不以路径模糊为由跳过）\n1. 读取接力棒（.agent/harness/_baton.md）获取当前状态\n2. 按状态机自动执行：START→ANALYZE→CONFIRM→DESIGN→IMPLEMENT→VERIFY→JUDGE（无需用户逐一下令）\n3. 每个阶段必须验证产物才能进入下一阶段\n4. 所有产物通过文件传递，禁止口头传递\n5. 用户必须在 CONFIRM 阶段确认后才能继续\n6. 每步回复第一行必须输出\"当前状态：[状态名]，下一步：[操作]\"\n7. 每步结束执行验证链检查（计数验证/列表验证/文件验证），防止虚假完成\n\n**What it produces**:\n- 需求分析报告（_analysis.md）\n- 技术设计文档（_design.md）\n- 实现摘要（_implementation.md）\n- 验证报告（_verification.md）\n- 接力棒状态（_baton.md）\n- **质量审核报告（_quality_audit_analysis.md / _quality_audit_design.md / _quality_audit_implement.md / _quality_audit_verify.md / _quality_audit_judge.md）**", "description_zh": "项目全生命周期管理引擎。用于系统化、流程化地执行软件工程任务,从分析需求、功能设计、任务计划、执行开发、审核验收全流程自动跟进，渐进式披露按需加载，非常流畅贴心的软件工程管理skill", "downloads": 47, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_c4926d5a/reqplan-v3", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/c0bd7863-2689-46f1-941c-e45be1317e90.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "ReqPlan-v3", "ownerName": "user_c4926d5a", "score": 82456.14035087719, "slug": "reqplan-v3", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780440409125, "version": "5.1.0"}]}